    me_method_receiver_field_write_lost_native_2026-11-09, 0, "Native: a me method doing self.f = self.f + y (desugared to self.f.merge(y)) never stored the field back; var b = Box(n: 2); b.bump(\"xyz\") printed n=2 (interpreter n=5). Same class as PR #7998 (merge missing from is_mutating_method). Prevention spec test/01_unit/compiler/50.mir/me_method_field_writeback_spec.spl."

