    me_method_receiver_field_write_lost_native_2026-11-09, 0, "red native stage2_new4 (base 1f0674fc682): n=2 and siblings b/c/hi/hc/a/ca all 2; IR shows Box.bump loads self.n into alloca and never stores it. MIR spec red at 1f0674fc682 (no SetField), green at 110719b6d2a; disabling the merge entry of #7998 turns it red again. Native re-verify needs a stage2 rebuilt from >= 1e5c263034a."

